This project is an ASP.NET Core Web API for managing the people who are in running, walking, and cycling events.
This project of mine makes use of C#, SQL Server and Swagger.

User Roles:

Participant - can register and log in, view and update their own profile, browse events and types of events, enroll in events and view their own results.
Organiser - can manage their own events and types of events, view enrolments for their own events and capture results for those enrolments
Public visitor - can register, log in and browse events and types of events

Main Folders:

Controllers - API endpoints
Models - Database models
RaceDayDatabase - Entity Framework database context

Created an SQL and intergrated it into my code.
